&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor’s degree required; MBA or advanced degree preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years of experience in strategy, business planning, ads monetization, consulting, or related fields&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience leading advertising or marketplace monetization strategy within a platform, e-commerce, delivery, or digital media company&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong track record of owning large-scale initiatives and driving measurable financial impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exceptional analytical skills with deep comfort in data-driven decision making and financial modeling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
