&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior stakeholders and lead complex, cross-functional initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-paced, high-growth, and ambiguous environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication in both Japanese and English&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
