&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This is a role for someone who is energized&amp;nbsp;by building –&amp;nbsp;building teams, building playbooks, and building a world-class experience for our customers. You will report to senior leadership and serve as a key connector across Sales, Product, and Customer Success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
