&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BAYADA in Middlesex/Somerset County, NJ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We have a wide range of cases across Middlesex and Somerset County from infant age to adults in both the school and home setting. We also offer paid training to our nurses that are interested in up-coding their skills (infant, pediatrics, tracheostomy/ventilator for both peds and adults).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(204, 9, 47);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RN and LPN Field Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;One on one care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
